<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh industry output rose 2.9 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Kazakh industry output rose 2.9 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's industrial production rose 2.9 percent in November after rising 4.5 percent in October, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   NOV 96  OCT 96  NOV 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change  +2.9    +4.5    +1.4</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change    +0.2    -9.5    -7.7</p>
<p>Industrial production in the first 11 months of this year was 0.1 percent above year-ago levels.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
